Z||000004||wkayl||02-20-2000||07:58 PM||||He runs the steering up from the rack and pinion.  Everything from the windshield back is almost stock.  He said he has had it up to 80mph with no problem (said he got stopped by  HP and had long interogation).  The car wasn't cherry by any meens when he started.  By the way he talked, he would sell it for about $2,000 to start over with a V6. He was at a bike show and realy ticked off a guy with a Honda Goldwing trike by winning the 3 wheeler class.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2mc.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by wkayl (edited 02-20-2000).]||||reg||1
