Z||000007||SN1PERVII||02-21-2000||01:07 AM||||I was considering finding a wrecked fiero and making a trike out of it. NOT LIKE THAT THOUGH. what I had envisioned was basicly chop it like that trailer with how everything above the deck lid was removed but leave the running gear intact. Take the front clip and trim the center section to make like those little wing things like topfuel dragsters have infront of the wheels. top ti all off with a ninja front end. <P>please dont hate  me because I would be use a rice bike. I would need the faring to hide the gas tank. <P>Three things stoping me though. <P>#1 how to fit an adiqatly sized radiator in the mix( i have a few ideas on this). <P>B: I have a pretty good idea that to do this would be way, way,way over my head.<P>#4 I have never worked with plastic body work before and a custom one off job would not be my choice of ways to start.<P>If I could find a beater for the right price( as in almost free) i might try it. it would sure look better than a VW trike. <P>I am gonna draw up some concept pics just to see how it would actually look. It is so crazy it may just work(yeah right!)||||reg||1
